WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Of course my special thoughts
go to the Prime Ministers of Denmark, -

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:43.000
- Ireland and the United Kingdom -

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:48.500
- who are for the first time attending 
this conference of the enlarged Community.

